## Node identity and runtime flags for mcl_distributor.
-name ${MCL_NODE_NAME}@${MCL_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${MCL_COOKIE}

+K true

## Async thread pool: pulls arrive over the pool's sockets.
+A 16

## A distributor under a pull storm must queue, not crash the VM on
## process limits.
+P 1048576
+Q 1048576
